   5+ 4010
   6+ 4010              ; entry points
   7+ 4010              RDSLT    EQU $000C      ; A = the byte at HL in slot A, a slot ID (chapter 38)
   8+ 4010              WRSLT    EQU $0014      ; E to the address HL in slot A
